sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Student as Student Candidate
    participant API as Attempts API (api/v1/attempts.py)
    participant Dep as Auth Dependencies (api/deps.py)
    participant Svc as AttemptService (services/attempt_service.py)
    participant DB as Relational Persistence (PostgreSQL/SQLite)
    participant Audit as AuditService (services/audit_service.py)

    Student->>API: POST /api/v1/attempts/start/{exam_id} (Bearer JWT)
    API->>Dep: get_current_user() & require_role(STUDENT)
    Dep->>Dep: Validate JWT Signature, Check Expiration, Extract user_id
    Dep-->>API: Authenticated Student Entity
    API->>Svc: start_attempt(exam_id, student, ip)
    Svc->>DB: Query Exam with Questions & Options
    DB-->>Svc: Exam Record
    alt Exam is DRAFT or CLOSED
        Svc-->>API: 400 Bad Request ("Examination is not open for attempts")
        API-->>Student: 400 Bad Request
    else Exam is PUBLISHED
        Svc->>DB: Check for Existing Unsubmitted Attempt
        DB-->>Svc: Existing Attempt (or None)
        alt Resuming Valid Active Attempt
            Svc->>Svc: Calculate remaining_seconds = expires_at - server_now
        else New Attempt
            Svc->>Svc: Compute server-authoritative timestamps:<br/>started_at = utcnow()<br/>expires_at = started_at + exam.duration
            Svc->>DB: Insert ExamAttempt(status=IN_PROGRESS, started_at, expires_at)
            Svc->>Audit: log_event("ATTEMPT_STARTED", student.id, exam.id)
        end
        Svc->>Svc: Strip Confidential Keys (`is_correct`, `explanation`) from Options
        Svc-->>API: AttemptStartResponse(attempt_id, remaining_seconds, sanitized_questions)
        API-->>Student: 201 Created (Safe Candidate Payload)
    end